@startuml
title AI Quote Generator Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "Browser Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Flask Backend" as Backend
participant "Large Language Model API" as LLM
participant "Pollinations Image API" as ImageAPI

User -> Frontend : Open the web page
Frontend -> Backend : GET /
Backend -> ImageAPI : Request generated image
ImageAPI --> Backend : Return generated image
Backend --> Frontend : Return index.html and image route
Frontend --> User : Display page with generated image

User -> Frontend : Click "Get Quote"
Frontend -> Backend : GET /api/quote
Backend -> LLM : Generate or retrieve inspirational quote
LLM --> Backend : Return quote text
Backend --> Frontend : Return quote as JSON
Frontend --> User : Update quote text on the page

@enduml
